{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "a94b9728dfaa232d6f29960c49364a75917c2262cde385dfd82203f00d609712", "ja": "巻き起こせ、新しい風！", "zh": "掀起吧，全新的風潮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d99927bad0860767ac5aee393ebcd9028380fa40ff370b53cb9ecd7e04672292", "ja": "ディレクターから八百長を持ちかけられ、悩\nむプロデューサー。しかし、真剣に取り組む\n一同を見て、ガチンコ勝負をさせて欲しいと\n頭を下げる。思いは通じ、真剣勝負は紬＆風\n花チームの勝利で幕を下ろす。", "zh": "导演提出要和制作人打假赛，让制作人十分苦恼。\n然而看到大家都在认真对待，制作人低头请求让她们进行一场真正的较量。\n他的心意得到了理解，最终这场认真较量以紬＆风花队获胜落下帷幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e2e38c04607b8321ccd3eb7d3c47def733b71e4b991a320ac99c012e62c499cc", "ja": "（本番撮影、二日目。昨日ディレクターから提案\nされたのは、台本（ブック）……つまり、八百長だ）", "zh": "（正式拍摄，第二天。昨天导演提议的是剧本（剧本安排）……也就是说，是一场假赛）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "add2a34abc048bef024038bea0bd00e765c7bca9b9770aae6879e9f0888ff18c", "ja": "（内容は単純で、響と茜のチームを勝たせたいとの事。\nまだ返事はしていないが……）", "zh": "（内容很简单，对方想让响和茜的队伍获胜。\n虽然我还没有答复……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "490f303afddd112c754d42210a5102f24fdbcc6d6540b4a7c56c1342d78b9edf", "ja": "豊川さん、ここが勝負どころですね……\nWEB投票では、リードされてしまっていますから。", "zh": "丰川小姐，这里就是决胜关头了呢……\n因为在网络投票中，我们目前处于落后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f5760c7bd1a9f9c6519f6bf951f01bd2aaabd49025c9a8913fde5898f599945d", "ja": "うん……結局、総合点で逆転されちゃったもんね。\nやっぱり茜ちゃん、こういうとき強いなぁ。", "zh": "嗯……毕竟在综合得分上被反超了呢。\n真不愧是小茜，这种时候好强啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1004_tencho", "source_sha256": "3b75c6496c78e3421f562623096b71d6d0e912fa27d243becf18ef90e0fc83eb", "ja": "な～に、こっちはこっちの仕事をするだけや。\n頼りにしてるで、おふたりさん。", "zh": "没什么，我们这边做好自己的工作就行。  \n就靠你们两位了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4c54c71e2efe4e8a6fa3cc35739de9950f8445aeb426d5f2056b23c1e0971e41", "ja": "店長さん……はい、お任せください。\nきっと、私たちなら……。", "zh": "店长……好的，请交给我们吧。\n只要是我们的话，一定能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "08539238ea49fd717d462b7e7877adf1d06a1492f9094fd7ec203d975abdb880", "ja": "ふっふっふ……作戦通り！　SNS映えする\nタコライスは、むしろWEBこそが主戦場なのだ！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……一切都按计划进行！适合发到社交平台的塔可饭，反倒正是以WEB为主战场的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "1682f5a1fa9347a9dbaf47560b941de0d43e5137f87a4f1050bd7cf93477c4a2", "ja": "あっちの幕の内がメチャクチャ美味しくても、\n食べなきゃ味はわからないからね！　ニャハハハーッ！", "zh": "就算那边的幕之内便当超级好吃，\n不亲口尝尝也不知道味道嘛！喵哈哈哈——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "5f80f2a367e1a4a12f729d77fc70cc58c4e316e3cade0b24cf87d0008591a58e", "ja": "むむむ。茜の作戦、すごいとは思うけど……\n自分は味でも負けてないと思ってるぞ！", "zh": "唔唔唔。虽然觉得茜的作战是很厉害啦……\n但我也觉得自己这边在味道上也是不会输的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1009_shachochan", "source_sha256": "122a2a08ed63e5e5bb92cb0c898b98bd8e97b69f7e22efb6962c714b5dda8712", "ja": "響ちゃん、大丈夫やって！　負けてへんから。\n今日売りまくって証明したろ？　な♪", "zh": "响，没事的啦！我们又没输。\n今天卖个痛快来证明给他们看吧？嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "bd509c0e7bbe07dc9e573e512e915abf5d7955e9e5f136d0a23b6ed2d9331d7f", "ja": "うん、そうだよね……よしっ！\n売って売って、売りまくるぞーっ！", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样……好！\n卖出更多、更多，再卖个痛快吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9031aacb78a594dcdd6d5be43b0f9e210c92d2cec0a29525439662973630df62", "ja": "（どっちのチームも、凄い熱量だ！　台本という\n事になれば、この気迫は失われるかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（两支队伍的热情都好惊人！要是变成剧本的话，这股气势或许就会消失了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1012_null", "source_sha256": "c8c5bfe214f24c4157b889359497e316b0fc453ced494ee19392847b7fed81fb", "ja": "ざわざわ……がやがや……。", "zh": "窸窸窣窣……吵吵嚷嚷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "38623b79e8aa36ee3abbd1af1276fe7e1398bfbf2780ef68f2c5afe643e8fc02", "ja": "いらっしゃいませ！　いらっしゃいませ！\n本場沖縄仕込みのタコライス、すっごくおいしいぞっ！", "zh": "欢迎光临！欢迎光临！\n正宗冲绳风味的塔可饭，超级美味的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "c3261fa54ad5170afe730c45e66d7a95cfe39acd548b9af273ee5c7ac53b6cc1", "ja": "今ならオマケの、茜ちゃんスマイルがついてくる！\n今日だけの限定スマイルだよ☆　ニヤリッ！", "zh": "现在还会附赠小茜微笑！只有今天才有的限定微笑哦☆　得意地一笑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1015_shachochan", "source_sha256": "c230acbcb7e9792f8109f6218d98ba20d41e0fc8fa38d38d0d5f72ed0003b2d1", "ja": "すご！　ふたりの呼び込み、どんどんお客さんを\n吸い込んで……ブラックホールみたいやん！", "zh": "好厉害！你们俩的招揽，把客人源源不断地吸引过来……简直就像黑洞一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "1c405cbae6325baa862713cf73d633d810bf4638bc30acb82f0cf518b72fbc3a", "ja": "それ、もうちょっとカワイイ例えなかった？", "zh": "就不能换个更可爱的比喻吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "d7e237867e5010d77994f93c54b36cce3c637f1c82c9be8e6106de4c7ec5786a", "ja": "まだまだこんなもんじゃないぞ。\nすぅ～……いらっ、しゃい、ませーっ！！", "zh": "可还不止这种程度哦。\n吸～……欢、迎、光、临——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6295238ffb9f078f24d62002df710c4befa0a7273405eff675be09505d310313", "ja": "（響たちがリードをキープしたまま、中休みになった。\nそろそろ、ディレクターに返事をしないと……）", "zh": "（响她们保持着领先进入了中场休息。\n差不多该回复导演了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "34abe2ec3654d579d7ac94dd48f7ac86046d75ce84abe3672d13137f54992ee9", "ja": "お疲れさま！　茜ちゃんたち、勢いすごいね……！\n前半戦、すっかりリードされちゃった。", "zh": "辛苦了！小茜她们气势真强啊……！\n上半场完全被她们领先了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "06dd7094d4a65e961e7f444ab0d68531c6755b0bc13f7f7ca8e87b286724cf8f", "ja": "えへへっ、ありがと♪　でも、そっちも凄いよね！\n差が広がらないから、油断できないぞ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢♪不过你们也很厉害嘛！\n因为差距没有拉大，所以可不能掉以轻心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "498f1c751aaf91f8cb526ee977229ce45b1c03e34d3c69ee2f90306ef1961765", "ja": "はい、私たちも、まだまだ頑張ります。\n後半戦は、とっておきの秘策を用意していますから。", "zh": "是的，我们也会继续努力的。\n因为后半程已经准备好了压轴的秘密策略。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "0ebbba2aaed476bcdf5250473a0886a426cc22c39e82c5b26f613870681fb08f", "ja": "ほうほう、秘策とな……つむりん、\nそれ教えていいの？　こっちも準備しちゃうゾ☆", "zh": "哦哦，原来是秘策啊……小紬，这样告诉我们真的好吗？那我们这边也要准备起来咯☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "68af9e4a153e645571f7483e4fa137746c865847cde388e8c8bb9c9b73ad2bab", "ja": "え、あっ……野々原さん。\nあの、今のは聞かなかったことに……。", "zh": "诶，啊……野野原小姐。\n那个，刚才的话就当作没听见吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1024_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "a7077103f4a9bf2dfb32d39d9efb2b97e55a9ab65bcc1ead1c18e6e42640f3ec", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　いやー、盛り上がってますね。\nところでプロデューサーさん、例のお話ですが……。", "zh": "辛苦了！哎呀，气氛真热烈啊。\n对了，制作人先生，关于之前提到的那件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "107665167da35de6dd948185c0cd8a201a0e61d385df0c03eed8a5c853fb190c", "ja": "あ、ああ、お疲れさまです！\nええと、それなんですが……何と言いますか……。", "zh": "啊，嗯，辛苦了！\n那个，关于那件事……该怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "6aa4b0552752cdb199540d30902deece89e467a11ef9bea6ffb236878cfd586c", "ja": "うん？　{$P$}ちゃん、\n何の話？", "zh": "嗯？{$P$}，你在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1027_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "f4b29e4c6f3afd096e3b103cbfdb0d0c80b575da83ef9d10443311507e3312c0", "ja": "あ、まだ聞いてません？　この勝負、『響＆茜チーム』\nの勝ち、という台本にしてもらえへんかって。", "zh": "啊，还没听说吗？能不能把这场比赛的剧本写成“响＆茜队获胜”啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8f6729639d3a2d4cc20f9645972e9e5500e2adedf76d4303a79f98bf8f98615c", "ja": "えっ……だ、台本って……。\n{$P$}さん、そうなんですか？", "zh": "咦……剧、剧本……。\n{$P$}先生，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d8016ce75a990c055bbce025dad734b1e0f705c6602154eaad4c35c1cdcf5260", "ja": "……うん。そういう話を頂いている。", "zh": "……嗯。确实有人来找我谈这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1030_013hib", "source_sha256": "b0f7d44c2ddbeb23dbf0a52cddb43cb7de9307b53b55956b33dc228d348cc319", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな……！\n自分、そんな勝ち方は……うぐっ、うぎぎ～～！", "zh": "诶！？怎么会……！\n我才不要用那种方式赢……呜咕，呜呜呜～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "707f2c18a782554d0894ca8a078fc31b94db3c69573e832ca2e9276e4b616fbb", "ja": "あ、あはは……なるほどね！\nまあ、しょうがないよね、お仕事だもんね……。", "zh": "啊、啊哈哈……原来如此！\n嗯，也没办法，毕竟是工作嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1033_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "8e31086cf659ba9501baa9a7541ab83c7841d3c538668d641611ef257c903512", "ja": "で、そろそろ、そういうシーンを入れていって\n貰いたいんですけど……お願いできます？", "zh": "那么，接下来也差不多该开始加入那种场景了……可以拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "158b4116d45a3b80819c53c3c514d329e8a7e96f76c381970b839a7d25bd32d0", "ja": "それは、ええと……。", "zh": "这个嘛，那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1035_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5bb251736b7e5825701b1c91969d50fbab2bf8418bb815e2522ef040c24a50f0", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\n私は……やれます。台本でも、大丈夫です。", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n我……能做到的。按剧本演也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "b9e32f3ae8b1be54b34b1d710cd34bb433dbda438a4c32a9f68a4abb115617bd", "ja": "……。\nディレクターさん、すみません……。", "zh": "……。\n导演，不好意思……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_1037", "source_sha256": "b1c157dca0f02e879aecce5dcbeffd656faaaa82ee3d5f046a31eb937f0cad87", "ja": "ガチンコで！", "zh": "认真来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "1f4465b47c34805751a102c26f13748ea0b7802f904f5f14e0e82ce99e048e54", "ja": "今回ばかりは、ガチンコでやらせてくれませんか？\nどうかこの通り……お願いいたします！", "zh": "这次就让我真刀真枪地来一次，可以吗？\n拜托了，就当我求你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2001_013hib", "source_sha256": "8b7ed425578a2660ae600cf23acb493b95002e5b338f7fece89c7eba25cc0b3c", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}！？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2002_p", "source_sha256": "bd513ca42284db42ea997384877c2993f02f7476f0653d5aa8171b624b1ab646", "ja": "ひとりのプロデューサーとして、全力で戦っている\nアイドル達に手を抜けとは、言いたくありません。", "zh": "作为制作人，我不想对那些正在全力战斗的偶像们说“不要拼尽全力”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2004_013hib", "source_sha256": "a31b4dfd9ac4c93622af0e423f9c7c5743730c8d34508fd9e7b0352357a22d72", "ja": "ディレクターさん、大丈夫だぞ！\n台本なんてなくても、自分達が勝てば同じでしょ？", "zh": "导演，没事的！\n就算没有剧本，只要我们赢了不就一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2005_023aka", "source_sha256": "a44c97b0c67a07efc75bb8c80f76621eb1eccfbdaa2db427ac5149d4169b8e50", "ja": "うんうん！　茜ちゃんにだって、まだまだ\n勝利へのプランがあるから。負ける気はないよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！就算是小茜，也还有很多通往胜利的计划呢。可没有要输的打算！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2006_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "bedd183d1052625556eb8d2a2ca9c29bf5ec9488f5325c699484deb7f08cb8a9", "ja": "ん～、まあ、気持ちはわかりますけどもねえ……。\nぶっちゃけ、どうなんでしょう？", "zh": "嗯～我也明白你的心情，不过嘛……  \n说实话，到底怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2007_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "d3188ffd89468fada910594bcabdf9a28f4cd30d107258ad9a7a9107b834dece", "ja": "自分のとこのアイドル可愛さに、\nこっちの提案を蹴るっちゅうんは、どうもなぁ……。", "zh": "因为自己这边的偶像太可爱，就拒绝我们的提议，总觉得不太好吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2008_p", "source_sha256": "792a34478e6a56cf00e44a91bd2190f1bfd5eec77344951862712c3afd38a3e7", "ja": "いえ、それだけが理由じゃありません。\n昨日、仰いましたよね？　新しい風になれ、って。", "zh": "不，那并不只是因为这个理由。\n您昨天说过的吧？要成为一股新风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2009_p", "source_sha256": "ec16226405ad79b1d84da354ae4885ced93f0997474f6ba542b3b08d20464cfd", "ja": "うちのアイドル達の本気が巻き起こす、熱い嵐……。\nそれこそが、あなたが待っていた風だからです！", "zh": "我家偶像们动真格所掀起的那场灼热风暴……\n那才是您一直在等待的风！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ed90f9001fb25552b11909eeea0ac2fc5555ff5c763b45216dc9c1bef062dd82", "ja": "台本となれば、全力でやります。でも、できれば……\n応援してくださるファンを、裏切りたくはありません。", "zh": "如果是台本安排，我会全力以赴。可是，如果可以的话……\n我不想辜负支持着我们的粉丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c6a59e8a6fdd908c2bf80dd25e8cd6239b38620982999d9233f31f64adce4bda", "ja": "お願いします、ディレクターさん……\n私たちに、本気でやらせてください！", "zh": "拜托了，导演先生……请让我们认真来一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2013_oogosho", "source_sha256": "d5146bb9ee8ac0d9cae1ec3349c4d2cad4166ceaa2b44f271354f41b70e2ea76", "ja": "……。ええやんか、ディレクターはん。\n俺かて、たまにはガチンコ勝負が見たいわ。", "zh": "……有什么不好的嘛，总监先生。\n我也偶尔想看看动真格的较量啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2014_wakategeinin", "source_sha256": "c51f4e0b7be056720b76e80f72e07cd4265f6ba81221029172811e284ac5e9ea", "ja": "オレからも、お願いします！　なんなら、\nギャラ半分にしてもろても……あ、やっぱナシで。", "zh": "我这边也拜托了！要不然，片酬减半也……啊，还是算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d9e9e892fca3184f4bf8a17486dfb8e3c2ee56df2ddec1fcdf8dffdb55506318", "ja": "！？　審査員のみなさん……！", "zh": "！？各位评委……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2016_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "2140c8c1db7667b5cd971cf5dcbb52857a6316f333ef0d8a5ea5aac1624d59fd", "ja": "はは……師匠が仰るんじゃ、敵わんわ。\nわかりました、お任せします。面白くしたってや！", "zh": "哈哈……既然师父都这么说了，我也没法反驳啊。\n明白了，就交给你了。可要把它搞得有意思点啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3c57ce3087cb28b4b65f21e995d888a7407be04e322cd5fad2eee93283ad9d02", "ja": "……っ！　は、はいっ！", "zh": "……！好的，是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2018_013hib", "source_sha256": "3449d955ab4241b2d9a3042627177e199191a7729eff7c4ccc2a5d157b2591d8", "ja": "……っ！　はいっ！", "zh": "……！是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3449d955ab4241b2d9a3042627177e199191a7729eff7c4ccc2a5d157b2591d8", "ja": "……っ！　はいっ！", "zh": "……！是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2020_023aka", "source_sha256": "3449d955ab4241b2d9a3042627177e199191a7729eff7c4ccc2a5d157b2591d8", "ja": "……っ！　はいっ！", "zh": "……！是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2021_p", "source_sha256": "009fd3c55a1d20ba9f1e8cc0380d52ff53ad282718cc253725c1265d749c67a5", "ja": "（そして、筋書きのないバトルは後半戦に突入！\n大阪駅を包む熱気はどんどん上がっていき……）", "zh": "（然后，这场没有剧本的对决进入了下半场！包围着大阪站的热烈气氛也越来越高涨……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bdebd6d80dcbfea309963213cd06adc9a522b1163751a3683ee6c7f9ab9ab59f", "ja": "店長さん、戻りました！　持って行ったお弁当、\n全部売れましたから、次のいただいていきますね！", "zh": "店长，我回来了！带出去的便当\n全都卖光了，我接着拿下一批过去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2023_tencho", "source_sha256": "e21a48bd1b097ed8b6883c11796b387b84c37a103688f8d245d2895f81d79a60", "ja": "あ、ああ……あんたら大丈夫なんか？　疲れるやろ、\n弁当の手売りなんて。今どきの若い子が……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……你们没事吧？亲手卖便当什么的，肯定很累吧。现在的年轻人真是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "94a8af664855fa6f2e74b1533417ffa58522b814afec1f0fccfb4365688b3aaf", "ja": "大丈夫です。アイドルは体力勝負ですから。\nひとつでも多く、地道に売る……これが、秘策です！", "zh": "没关系的。偶像拼的就是体力。\n脚踏实地，能多卖一份是一份……这就是，秘策！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2025_023aka", "source_sha256": "2dffa6a0488ded899835fb6873fc62e6c34b4c901f142348638cb38492fd3465", "ja": "さあさあ、タイムサービス開始！　今なら\nひびきん特製のサーターアンダギーが付いちゃうよ♪", "zh": "来来，限时特惠开始啦！现在购买还附送响响特制的萨塔安达吉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2026_shachochan", "source_sha256": "19c82b8e3f6f44c5a43e108e4cfc6d2c5a51f867b995c5aa3309c0afa55a082e", "ja": "うちも食べたけど、これホンマ美味しいからね！？\n食べとかんと損するで～！", "zh": "我也吃过了，这个真的超好吃哦！？\n不吃的话可就亏大了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2027_013hib", "source_sha256": "e17f66355ba43745f98353d1b584c0864951eb2315537e8078672168597c7328", "ja": "えへへっ、自信作だぞ～！　\n食後のおやつにどうぞーっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，这是我的得意之作哦～！\n饭后的点心请用——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2029_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "3578a26b5487f3fe9696c0f29452c65c7b0cb3b9aabb466deed10aea817b56ec", "ja": "……はいっ、そこまで！　終了ーーーーーっ！\nさあ、今日の熱戦を制したのは……。", "zh": "……好，到此为止！结束啦————！\n那么，拿下今日这场激战胜利的是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2030_meibutsushikai", "source_sha256": "9c6dfeb3632f552bf37d448843cd35c8554421801b0903218d9beab9503b5920", "ja": "『紬＆風花』チームゥゥゥゥーッ！！", "zh": "『纺织＆风花』队伍——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2031_013hib", "source_sha256": "1f4d940bc4fe0567f192018a36cdfb4a6844a1d278937926dfae3a933770da16", "ja": "う、う……うぎゃー！？\nまさか、最後の最後で逆転されるなんて……。", "zh": "呜、呜……呜哇——！？\n没想到竟然在最后关头被反超了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2032_023aka", "source_sha256": "2fd54a1341e322f326addcb872ef8e9b9bb2a81899adb66de2e294b5c0e82461", "ja": "くぅ、手売り販売なんて思いつかなかったよ！\nこっちも販売域を広げるべきだった……悔しいっ！", "zh": "呜，居然没想到要亲自挨家挨户地卖啊！\n我们这边也该扩大销售范围的……真不甘心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "49b4fa6aa6db27d4dbb304789143af38143c4a7279374f5456f6b93b0dd39d7a", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……か、勝った、勝ったよ紬ちゃん！\nふぅ、さすがにもう、ヘトヘトかも……。", "zh": "哈、哈……赢、赢了，紬！\n呼……果然已经累得筋疲力尽了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2034_051tmg", "source_sha256": "28c2dc7d319fdad13cc41d370e8ce0f06512d197cc22b59a8b1e1e14fc8ab6f8", "ja": "と、豊川さん……私も、もう限界です……。\nなんだかすごく、お腹が空きました……ふぅ。", "zh": "丰川同学……我、我也已经到极限了……总觉得特别饿……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_06_2035_p", "source_sha256": "e745e15de7f1b03dd14c85abf9f65a5be2558df293b5d29f11df893ec84c3f98", "ja": "（大阪駅で繰り広げられた熱い戦いは、こうして\n幕を下ろしたのだった……みんな、お疲れさま！）", "zh": "（在大阪站展开的激烈战斗，就这样落下了帷幕……大家辛苦了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
